{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47106","headline":"峡中酬荆南郑准 · 尚颜","name":"峡中酬荆南郑准","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山斋西向蜀江濆，四载安居复有羣。\n风雁势高犹可见，雪猿声苦不堪闻。\n新诗写出难胜宝，破衲披行却类云。\n每喜泝流宾客说，元瑜刀笔润雄军。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"尚颜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47106.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47106","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}